							"type": "paragraph",
							"content": [
								{
									"type": "text",
									"text": "Event handling in JavaScript allows you to respond to user actions like clicks, key presses, mouse movements, etc. You can attach event listeners to HTML elements so that when an event occurs, a function (event handler) is executed."
